  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the pasta according to package instructions.",
    "In a large skillet, saute the chopped onion, garlic, carrots, and celery in vegan butter until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the broad beans to the skillet and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the nutritional yeast, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Combine the cooked pasta and soffritto mixture in a large bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Let the dish cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Store any leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
